:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.14</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Updated to vanilla version 0.5.11.8.
		</li>
		<li>Updated to DoLP version 0.762.
		</li>
		<li>Updated chastity belts and cages
		<ul>
			<li>Sirris now sells non-cursed "fetish" versions of the dildo chastity belt and flat chastity cage at the adult shop.
			</li>
			<li>They cost more than the temple's basic fitting and have reduced, unrepairable durability, but can be put on and removed freely.
			</li>
			<li>Adult-shop devices include a key. Keys can break during removal, disappear while the player is unconscious, or be stolen by angry encounter NPCs.
			</li>
			<li>Sirris can cut off non-antique chastity devices when the key is gone, though the device is destroyed.
			</li>
			<li>Passive chastity arousal starts with a 50% cap, falling to 5% after two weeks of acclimation. Direct stimulation can still raise arousal beyond that cap, while ordinary penis or clit rubbing from clothing is blocked by the chastity device.
			</li>
			<li>Angry opponents, including Whitney and Kylar, may fit a chastity device after an encounter and keep its key.
			</li>
			<li>The flat cage now shrinks the penis twice as quickly and consistently conceals it beneath underwear.
			</li>
			<li>Losing a bullet vibrator's remote removes its controls and allows its setting to change unpredictably. The clothing summary warns when the vibe is trapped inside, and intense contractions during sex or masturbation may force it out.
			</li>
			<li>The Wardrobe now has a Genitals category, allowing genital-slot clothing to be stripped, stored, and browsed like other clothing.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated how misgendering works
		<ul>
			<li>Generic and stranger forms of address now follow the player's appearance, allowing a stranger's assumption to clash with the player's identity and trigger genuine misgendering reactions.
			</li>
			<li>NPCs who know the player well (50+ Love, or explicitly told) can use the correct address through an optional NPC-name argument. Existing dialogue has not yet been retrofitted to pass it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Kylar's Creep scene
		<ul>
			<li>Kylar can no longer penetrate through a locked chastity belt or cage and now reacts with appropriate frustration when blocked.
			</li>
			<li>Successful penetration now records vaginal, anal, or penile virginity loss correctly.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Made Whitney's forced and romantic kisses mask-aware
		<ul>
			<li>Whitney now pulls masks and gags aside before kissing the player.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved Avery's favourite-meal rewards
		<ul>
			<li>Serving Avery soufflé, linguine, or steak now deposits £2,000 into the player's HBSC account.
			</li>
			<li>Angel transformations increase the payment by 50%; Fallen Angel transformations increase it by 20%.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated the forest shop
		<ul>
			<li>Added the Kaiju costume and Whitney's collar to Gwylan's special-clothes stock.
			</li>
			<li>The Kaiju costume unlocks after taking Niki's flyer job. Whitney's collar unlocks when Whitney collars the player at school.
			</li>
			<li>Both items have Gwylan dialogue, can be purchased normally, or can be unlocked with the special-clothes feat boost for 2 coins.
			</li>
			<li>Whitney's actual collar is now always the leashed, unremovable version, while the forest shop sells a removable novelty replica.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added Whitney's toilet rule to the Journal
		<ul>
			<li>The Journal shows which toilets Whitney assigned, whether the player is breaking the rule, and which toilets the player is currently using.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added new underground slave content
		<ul>
			<li>After escaping the underground brothel at least once, the player can ask Bailey or Briar about high-paying work and sign a 7-, 14-, or 30-day contract.
			</li>
			<li>Payment is agreed when signing but is only awarded after completing the full contract.
			</li>
			<li>Each contract assigns a permanent, uniquely named Master or Mistress with their own personality. They may inspect, punish, or visit the player and react differently according to obedience.
			</li>
			<li>Work includes dancing, presentation, stage performances, films, hunts, and private shows.
			</li>
			<li>High obedience improves treatment, freedom, sleep, room access, and tips. Low obedience brings harsher punishments, restrictions, disturbed sleep, animal parties according to game settings, and possible unpaid contract extensions.
			</li>
			<li>Giving birth sends the player to hospital, after which they return underground if contract days remain.
			</li>
			<li>Completing the contract removes restraints, returns stored clothes, pays the agreed amount, and releases the player near the orphanage.
			</li>
			<li>The player can escape early by picking the room and outer-door locks or by defeating a handler, but forfeits all payment and may remain trapped in the brothel's collar and cuffs.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Brothel and Harvest Street
		<ul>
			<li>Brothel chatting now grants Kindness fame whether the English check succeeds or fails.
			</li>
			<li>Added two once-daily Harvest Street events after discovering the brothel. At low soft world corruption, the player may notice neatly dressed people leaving less lonely after using the brothel's conversation service.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added an ancient shrine buff
		<ul>
			<li>Praying at the ancient shrine now grants 8% better gambling luck until midnight.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Water Dragon content
		<ul>
			<li>Water Dragons can swim from the island back to the city after completing the spear event.
			</li>
			<li>Added three new ocean encounters.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated loitering
		<ul>
			<li>Loitering can lead to grateful people who simply need someone to listen to them.
			</li>
			<li>Named NPCs may also appear while looking out for the player.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Gentleman's Club blackmail
		<ul>
			<li>Added letter encounters at the Great Hawk tower, wolf cave, Eden's cabin, and temple.
			</li>
			<li>Added tasks to swim naked in the school pool and flash five strangers.
			</li>
			<li>The school-pool task only appears when the player has enough Exhibitionism to complete it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Realistic Childbirth
		<ul>
			<li>Fixed and expanded Gwylan childbirth dialogue, controls, and save-reload behaviour.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Decomod decorations
		<ul>
			<li>Added backgrounds and foregrounds by DECOMP CO ⁝ ⚰ (naturesmorticians).
			</li>
			<li>Added foregrounds by monoski1 and linnnn, and backgrounds by supervamp78.
			</li>
			<li>Tidied the decoration folders to remove duplication and misplaced assets.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated sleeping
		<ul>
			<li>Glasses now have a 32% chance to break when worn to sleep.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved compatibility with ModLoader clothes.
		</li>
		<li>Added selectable Water Dragon skin colours
		<ul>
			<li>The mirror now offers None, Lilac, Purple, Blue/Cyan, and Soft Pink.
			</li>
			<li>The original tan-responsive skin remains available through transformations and cheats.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated the Swell X-Change effect
		<ul>
			<li>Swell now enables automatic titfucking and autofellatio when the player's breasts or penis are large enough.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added the Critter Magnet trait
		<ul>
			<li>Repeated swarm and small-creature assaults can unlock Critter Magnet.
			</li>
			<li>The trait makes the player willingly strip and submit to critters, and reduces Stress and Trauma from critter sex.
			</li>
			<li>It can be removed or regained through the X-Change trait settings.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Rebalancing</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Rebalanced fame gains across events
		<ul>
			<li>Private scenes without witnesses grant 2–6 fame.
			</li>
			<li>Small audiences of 2–4 people grant 10–20 fame.
			</li>
			<li>Public, group, recorded, or distributed scenes grant 26–40 fame.
			</li>
			<li>Institution-wide or viral scenes grant 60 fame.
			</li>
			<li>Rare narrative climaxes grant 90+ fame, used sparingly.
			</li>
			<li>Exhibitionism, Modeling, and Social fame grow fastest. Sex, Good, Business, Scrap, and Pimp fame use the standard rate. Rape and Prostitution grow more slowly, while Bestiality grows slowest.
			</li>
			<li>Repeatable jobs remain near the bottom of their tier to limit farming.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Water Dragon balance
		<ul>
			<li>Water Dragon halves Swimming skill-check difficulty.
			</li>
			<li>Water Dragon now boosts only Swimming; its Athletics bonus was removed and its heat resistance was slightly reduced.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Reduced chastity arousal spikes by 50%
		<ul>
			<li>The event still occurs at the same rate, roughly once per in-game hour and more often with a chastity parasite.
			</li>
			<li>Each spike now adds 50–200 Arousal instead of 100–400.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Reduced blackmail income by 50%.
		</li>
		<li>Rebalanced animal-transformation income buffs
		<ul>
			<li>Harpy increases office, chalet, and pound wages by 45%.
			</li>
			<li>Bear doubles docker shift and overtime wages.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated strip-club dancing
		<ul>
			<li>Offers of prostitution work occur more often when the player has high fame and soft world corruption is low.
			</li>
			<li>Dancing now also increases Good fame.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Angels no longer bypass glory-hole consequences.
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Fixed pronoun and gender-appearance inconsistencies
		<ul>
			<li>Pronoun preferences can no longer end up with nothing selected and silently fall back to a stale internal value.
			</li>
			<li>Invalid existing saves are repaired on load, and new characters are protected at the end of character creation.
			</li>
			<li>The Pronoun settings tab's "Currently used" line now refreshes immediately.
			</li>
			<li>The mirror's Gender Appearance headline now follows the player's actual appearance and updates immediately when posture changes.
			</li>
			<li>Mirror text now distinguishes how the player identifies from how they currently appear to others.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed missing pronouns in the school hallway event when returning through passage history.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Temple confession crash
		<ul>
			<li>Both genital-initialisation paths now safely handle glory-hole encounters while preserving brothel-specific anal and oral descriptions.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed orphanage pass-out logic
		<ul>
			<li>Indoor hypothermia and heatstroke now use a home recovery scene instead of a stranger's car or an outdoor assault.
			</li>
			<li>Cold-bath blackouts safely wake the player in their bedroom.
			</li>
			<li>Locked-bedroom pass-outs cannot trigger Sold or Molestation outcomes.
			</li>
			<li>Bedroom, bathroom, main hall, and garden locations are now distinguished correctly; outdoor garden events are unchanged.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a formatting issue in Gwylan's ritual.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the broken chastity Temple conversation.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed purity loss during temporary X-Changes
		<ul>
			<li>Virginity-loss purity penalties are skipped while temporarily X-Changed, matching fallen-angel transformation events.
			</li>
			<li>The purity cap now checks the true body's virginity rather than the currently active body.
			</li>
			<li>Existing saves whose purity was already lost may not be repaired.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Reworded Grey Hyper Fertility text.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Whitney's rooftop event
		<ul>
			<li>"Swallow it in front of everyone" now correctly requires Exhibitionism 3.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed jewellery clothing
		<ul>
			<li>Expensive, Luxurious, and Extravagant labels now derive from each item's actual price.
			</li>
			<li>Removed three pearl earrings without artwork.
			</li>
			<li>Corrected the gold flower earring artwork and broken icons for Whitney's collar, the rivière necklace set, and a simple metal bracelet.
			</li>
			<li>Renamed a duplicate "flower gold earrings" entry.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Bailey using the wrong pronoun after spending the night with them.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Demon Force Impregnation after Genome Dump
		<ul>
			<li>The action remains available while visible demon traits such as horns, a tail, or wings remain.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed bike theft ignoring security at the lake
		<ul>
			<li>Lake theft chance now decreases with lock strength like other parking locations.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed virginity handling
		<ul>
			<li>Fallen Angel transformation now triggers immediately when virginity is lost during sex-machine, brothel glory-hole, and Robin crossdressing scenes.
			</li>
			<li>Partners with small or micro penises now use a unique "is it in yet?" reaction, lower Purity, and do not immediately remove virginity.
			</li>
			<li>The small/micro behaviour also applies when the player is penetrating.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Advanced Stats growth display
		<ul>
			<li>Identity-driven breast, butt, and penis growth percentages no longer freeze while the actual size continues changing.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed pronoun and gender displays
		<ul>
			<li>Pronoun settings now show every selected pronoun set.
			</li>
			<li>"Current Sex" pronouns use the player's actual sex, preventing incorrect they/them pronouns for characters with both genitals.
			</li>
			<li>Mirror descriptions use the correct text colour.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed both Plantperson traps
		<ul>
			<li>Deliberately taking the Moor bait grants +35 Control and begins consensual combat.
			</li>
			<li>Deliberate Forest and Moor choices now require Deviancy 3.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed redundant NPC generation during farm work.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed NPC generation and tentacle rendering
		<ul>
			<li>Tentacle encounters no longer create fake NPC data or cause "undefined vineperson" and animation errors in unrelated scenes.
			</li>
			<li>Rendering no longer mutates the NPC list.
			</li>
			<li>Also fixed related X-ray, condom-layer, grapple-animation, conversation water-breaking, and event-debug warning issues.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Gwylan's missing scheduled morning café walks
		<ul>
			<li>Unlocked walks appear on Domus and Danube Street at the promised time.
			</li>
			<li>Street, shop, wake-up, and renovation routes now remain consistent.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Avery's Bailey coverage
		<ul>
			<li>While Avery is paying, any overdue rent timer and Bailey's current missed-payment debt are cleared.
			</li>
			<li>Historical missed-payment statistics remain unchanged.
			</li>
			<li>Relentless Bailey still applies whenever Avery refuses payment.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed underground farm cleanup
		<ul>
			<li>Being rescued by Eden now clears the escape state correctly and restores the player's awareness of time.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Genome Dump Water Dragon completion
		<ul>
			<li>Players with 30–49 Draconism are no longer treated as fully transformed when only the tail is present.
			</li>
			<li>Completion now checks the aquatic trait, which activates at 50 Draconism.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed body-trait insecurities
		<ul>
			<li>Accepting chest size, penis size, or pregnancy in Gender Identity prevents the related insecurity penalties and events.
			</li>
			<li>Rejected or unselected traits behave as before, and players not using Gender Identity are unaffected.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed random character settings
		<ul>
			<li>Random creation selects at most one trait from each mutually exclusive group.
			</li>
			<li>Conflicting traits from existing saves can be unchecked so affected characters can recover.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed body type and hermaphrodite detection
		<ul>
			<li>New and random characters now receive the body type matching their selected sex.
			</li>
			<li>Existing saves are repaired automatically unless an X-Change transformation is active.
			</li>
			<li>Characters with both genitals are now recognised correctly in combat, portraits, events, pregnancy inheritance, and breast-size insecurity.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Realistic Childbirth crashes
		<ul>
			<li>Missing or invalid birth types are repaired automatically and use fallback text when a specific scene is unavailable.
			</li>
			<li>Restored missing pain-relief and partner text during bedroom births.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed an empty asylum birth option and a recovery path that could incorrectly use the egg-laying ending.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the confession requirement
		<ul>
			<li>"Confess your impurity" now requires 700 Purity or less, or Demon pure TF level 6 or higher.
			</li>
			<li>Cosmetic demon traits still affect dialogue but can no longer unlock the purity gain.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed X-Change effect-only pills
		<ul>
			<li>Grey Breeder, Alpha, Swell, Bimbo, and Fertility pills no longer reset body changes, virginity history, fame, crime, Promiscuity, Exhibitionism, or Deviancy when their effects end.
			</li>
			<li>Herm and gender-swap sessions now check the correct body's virginity history.
			</li>
			<li>Sex-changing pills still revert the body normally, including Grey pills when "Grey pills also flip gender" is enabled.
			</li>
			<li>The full fix may apply only to new saves, but restored virginity is harmless and later transformations should no longer reset it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Gentleman's Club blackmail tasks
		<ul>
			<li>The arcade air-hockey task completes after the strip game.
			</li>
			<li>Behaviour tasks such as "Don't act defiantly" check conduct only before the deadline rather than failing when the results letter is read.
			</li>
			<li>"Flirt with 3 people" and "wear a skirt" pill tasks no longer fail because of unrelated pills.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed non-stop strip-club dancing
		<ul>
			<li>Security ends the performance immediately when the club closes.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Gentleman's Club feats for older saves
		<ul>
			<li>Both Club feats are restored for older saves that already reached the unpaid stage.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#128444;</span> Art and Image Updates</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Image fixes and cleanup by Frostberg and Bec.
		</li>
		<li>Replaced Robin's NNPC sprites with u/Wonderful_Can_7086's rendition.
		</li>
		<li>Added Gwylan NNPC sprites by u/Wonderful_Can_7086.
		</li>
		<li>Whitney's vanilla sprite is now undressable.
		</li>
		<li>Added dark-skinned Robin NNPC sprites by u/Wonderful_Can_7086.
		</li>
		<li>Added Black Wolf NNPC sprites by u/Wonderful_Can_7086.
		</li>
		<li>Updated Mikili imagepack by Alexandrite-sama.
		</li>
		<li>Added Fox Familiar's Kaijuu costume for the femgoose imagepack.
		</li>
	</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
